(iv) the status of the contents (e.g. in quarantine, on test, released, rejected);
(v) an expiry date or a date beyond which retesting is necessary.
7.19. When fully computerised storage systems are used, all the above information need not necessarily be in a legible form on the label. The use of automated systems (e.g. use of barcodes) is permissible.

